|-
|country_event
|<code>id = <id></code><br>
The event id to fire.<br>
<code>days = <days></code><br>
Optional. The number of days to wait after the effect is executed to fire the event.<br>
<code>random = <days></code><br>
Optional. The max number of additional days that can be added to the ''days'' parameter for randomness.<br>
<code>tooltip = <string></code><br>
Optional. The tooltip to display in the effect tooltip ''country_event'' is used in.
|<pre>country_event = { 
    id = celestial_empire_events.1
    days = 30
    random = 15
    tooltip = CELESTIAL_EMPIRE_TOOLTIP
}</pre>
|Fire a country event for the current country scope.
|You cannot fire the same event within itself with a delay of 0.
|1.1
|-
|add_country_modifier
|<code>name = <name></code><br>
The event modifier to add.<br>
<code>duration = <days></code><br>
Optional. The number of days to add the country modifier for. -1 means until the end of the game.<br>
<code>hidden = yes</code><br>
Optional. Whether the country modifier is hidden in the government view.<br>
<code>desc = <string></code><br>
Optional. The string used to override the automatic duration string.
|<pre>
add_country_modifier = { 
    name = the_proper_old_ways
    duration = -1  
    desc = PROPER_OLD_WAYS_DESC_TOOLTIP
    hidden = yes
}
</pre>
|Adds an event modifier to the current scope as a country modifier.
| <code>duration</code> is optional, but the modifier will be removed after one day if it is not used.
|1.1
|-
