|add_accepted_culture_or_dip_power
|<code>culture = <string></code><br>
The name of the culture to add as an accepted culture.

<code>free = yes</code>

If yes, the specified culture will not consume an accepted culture slot. (''Irreversible'')

<code>dip_reward = yes</code>

Grants 100 diplomatic power if there are insufficient accepted culture slots.

<code>value = <int></code>

Grants the specified diplomatic power if there are insufficient accepted culture slots.
|'''Free culture slot:'''
<pre>add_accepted_culture_or_dip_power = {
    culture = french
    free = yes
}
</pre>'''Diplomatic power rewards:'''<pre>add_accepted_culture_or_dip_power = {
