    culture = french
    value = 75
}
</pre>
|Adds a new accepted culture to the current scope.
|In contrast to the standalone effect, this variant requires the culture to be specified by name.
The dip reward will only be granted if the country has zero remaining promoted culture slots. The effect will not grant a dip reward if <code>free = yes</code> is specified.

A culture granted with  <code>free = yes</code> will never take a culture slot and this cannot be reversed. The culture can still be promoted and demoted normally. 

Only the last used argument of <code>dip_reward = yes</code> and <code>value = <int></code> will be used.
