<code>max_random_dip = <int></code><br>
Optional. The maximum DIP skill roll for the heir.<br>
<code>max_random_mil = <int></code><br>
Optional. The maximum MIL skill roll for the heir.<br>
<code>hide_skills = yes</code><br>
