:<math>{ \text{number of regiments} = min \left( \text{owner forcelimit}, round \left[\left( 4.8 + 0.085 \cdot \text{total development} \right) \cdot (1 + 0.03 \cdot \text{technology level}) \cdot \left(\text{rebellion size} \cdot 0.95 + 0.05 \right)\right]\right) }</math>

